<title>AUSTRALIA: Dominion makes 1-for-2 option issue.</title>
<headline>Dominion makes 1-for-2 option issue.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Mining Ltd said on Tuesday it would make a free 1-for-2 options issue to shareholders, with the options convertible into common stock at the end of calendar 1998 at 70 cents per share.</p>
<p>The company said about 43 million options would be issued and about A$30 million would be raised on their exercise.  </p>
<p>The funds would be used to develop the Yakabindie nickel project in Western Australia and the Gawler gold project in South Australia.</p>
<p>The record date for entitlements to the issue would be September 24, with a closing date for acceptances of October 18.</p>
<p>Dominion Mining shares were steady at 70 cents on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
